[[0,1017557,0,31,0,31,"2016-05-02T20:32:05","lorlipone","",[],"","Star Fox - Ancient Japanese Style","https://i.sli.mg/BW8fRR.jpg","pics"],[1,5092384,0,1,0,1,"2016-05-02T20:56:20","WhiteRonin","",[],"<p>Awesome! Is this in poster size?</p>"],[2,5092625,5092384,0,0,0,"2016-05-02T21:24:02","lorlipone","",[],"<p>This is the only version I've seen. Do please link if find. </p>"],[3,5093560,5092625,1,0,1,"2016-05-02T23:07:04","WhiteRonin","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://shop.ukiyoeheroes.com/collections/handmade-woodblock-prints\">http://shop.ukiyoeheroes.com/collections/handmade-woodblock-prints</a></p>"],[4,5093730,5093560,1,0,1,"2016-05-02T23:25:11","lorlipone","",[],"<p>Whoa; that's awesome</p>"],[3,5093567,5092625,1,0,1,"2016-05-02T23:08:14","WhiteRonin","",[],"<p>The original looks to small to blow up with photoshop ... The shop price isn't bad but 7x9 ... small ...</p>"],[1,5093468,0,3,0,3,"2016-05-02T22:58:01","Wonko_the_Sane","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/Wt0Pb\">jed henry did a whole series of nintemdo characters from various games</a></p>"],[2,5093552,5093468,0,0,0,"2016-05-02T23:05:55","WhiteRonin","",[],"<p>Thanks!</p>"],[2,5095193,5093468,0,0,0,"2016-05-03T02:38:19","WeekendBaker","",[],"<p>Holy shit, that Kirby is nightmare fuel</p>"],[1,5093912,0,1,0,1,"2016-05-02T23:46:42","ponz","",[],"<p>I don't think this is actually ancient. Id love to know if I am wrong though. </p>"],[2,5094034,5093912,0,0,0,"2016-05-03T00:02:29","lorlipone","",[],"<p>Yeah, I think you're right. &quot;Ancient&quot; infers quite a bit older; I just didn't care enough to find the right word. </p>"],[2,5094120,5093912,0,0,0,"2016-05-03T00:14:13","WhiteRonin","",[],"<p>Wonko gave me a heads up and I found this:</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://shop.ukiyoeheroes.com/collections/handmade-woodblock-prints\">http://shop.ukiyoeheroes.com/collections/handmade-woodblock-prints</a></p>\n<p>It's an artist who is doing really good at copying the style of Japanese wood block prints.</p>"],[1,5094090,0,1,0,1,"2016-05-03T00:10:32","Scruffy_Nerfherder","",[],"<p>No one is doing a barrel roll.</p>"],[1,5094368,0,1,0,1,"2016-05-03T00:53:07","GoatSLAVE","",[],"<p>But wait, Nintendo is a Japanese company, so the original already was Japanese style...</p>"],[1,5095435,0,1,0,1,"2016-05-03T03:08:09","Spartanfoks","",[],"<p>I bought a print of it for one of my friend's birthday at comic-con. Lovely piece.</p>"]]
